From 2204996751d031794080d8a1a2b3a709dd734a52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Girija P <gpandiya@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 16:13:40 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] NLHAL: support full radio disable and enable lifecycle

Add complete NLHAL radio teardown/re-enable handling, including VAP teardown
confirmation, radio_disable state synchronization, no-VAP control-socket
support, WSI powersave handling, and cached wiphy recovery across interface
removal.

Signed-off-by: Girija P <gpandiya@qti.qualcomm.com>
